WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.030
- Please welcome someone
I just love so much

00:00:03.030 --> 00:00:04.760
and think so highly of,

00:00:04.760 --> 00:00:06.185
Topher Grace.

00:00:06.185 --> 00:00:09.907
(upbeat music)
(audience cheers)

00:00:09.907 --> 00:00:11.282
- Hi guys, yeah.

00:00:11.282 --> 00:00:12.115
I can't believe it.

00:00:12.115 --> 00:00:14.114
- [Drew] I've Scarlett
coming along tomorrow.

00:00:14.114 --> 00:00:16.393
- No way?
- Yes.

00:00:16.393 --> 00:00:18.540
Yes. I love that movie.
- It's so good to see you.

00:00:18.540 --> 00:00:20.930
- [Drew] Oh Topher, I'm
so happy to see you.

00:00:20.930 --> 00:00:23.750
- I am the eight millionth person

00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:25.590
to come on this show and say,

00:00:25.590 --> 00:00:26.423
this is the truth,

00:00:26.423 --> 00:00:28.590
that you are the nicest human in,

00:00:28.590 --> 00:00:30.710
definitely Hollywood,
(audience applauds)

00:00:30.710 --> 00:00:32.107
in the world, yeah.

00:00:32.107 --> 00:00:34.530
I see you say thank you
so much, on this show,

00:00:34.530 --> 00:00:35.860
to people all the time,

00:00:35.860 --> 00:00:37.990
but I don't know if you remember this.

00:00:37.990 --> 00:00:39.980
You shouldn't remember
this, but I remember this,

00:00:39.980 --> 00:00:43.230
'cause I was pulled out
of a high school play

00:00:43.230 --> 00:00:44.063
to be on 70's Show.

00:00:44.063 --> 00:00:45.600
I'd never acted before "That 70's Show",

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:49.410
and I saw you at the
Nickelodeon's Kids Choice Award.

00:00:49.410 --> 00:00:50.770
It was the first time I
ever presented an award

00:00:50.770 --> 00:00:51.960
at an awards ceremony.

00:00:51.960 --> 00:00:53.527
And someone came up to me and said,

00:00:53.527 --> 00:00:56.730
"Hey, someone wants to say hi to you."

00:00:56.730 --> 00:00:58.420
I said, "Oh okay."

00:00:58.420 --> 00:00:59.409
He said, "It's Drew Barrymore"
- Oh, now I know what-

00:00:59.409 --> 00:01:00.940
- I said, "Oh my God."
- you're talking about.

00:01:00.940 --> 00:01:01.887
- No, of course no. Now I know
what you're talking about.

00:01:01.887 --> 00:01:04.553
- You went on and on about
how much you liked the show.

00:01:04.553 --> 00:01:05.570
- Yeah, I was a huge fan!
- And it was genuine.

00:01:05.570 --> 00:01:07.860
At first, I thought it was
maybe like a Hollywood thing

00:01:07.860 --> 00:01:09.550
and then you were citing different things

00:01:09.550 --> 00:01:10.600
I'd done on the show.

00:01:10.600 --> 00:01:13.910
And I drove home whistling.

00:01:13.910 --> 00:01:14.880
I was so...

00:01:14.880 --> 00:01:16.440
I thought, oh my God, someone believes it.

00:01:16.440 --> 00:01:17.543
And the fact that I...

00:01:17.543 --> 00:01:19.280
I mean, you're such an icon,

00:01:19.280 --> 00:01:20.440
I couldn't believe you
were saying that to me.

00:01:20.440 --> 00:01:21.273
And then...

00:01:21.273 --> 00:01:22.110
and then the show did hit,

00:01:22.110 --> 00:01:24.395
you're such a wonderful
person, I'm so grateful.

00:01:24.395 --> 00:01:26.565
- Oh my God, thank you
so much for saying that.

00:01:26.565 --> 00:01:27.940
(audience applauds)

00:01:27.940 --> 00:01:30.000
Okay. So you did something

00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:34.750
that just has had me
all in a lather about,

00:01:34.750 --> 00:01:37.570
did you crash the Academy Awards?

00:01:37.570 --> 00:01:38.513
- Yeah. Right, so...

00:01:38.513 --> 00:01:40.440
- How did you do that?

00:01:40.440 --> 00:01:41.540
- I've been when I was invited,

00:01:41.540 --> 00:01:45.450
but before I went, I was still at USC

00:01:45.450 --> 00:01:47.230
and USC used to be
right across the street.

00:01:47.230 --> 00:01:48.080
- Shrine.
- Yeah.

00:01:48.080 --> 00:01:49.700
- Right across from the Shrine Auditorium,

00:01:49.700 --> 00:01:52.870
which the Academy was at for decades.

00:01:52.870 --> 00:01:56.813
- And we were up drinking
on a parking garage-

00:01:56.813 --> 00:01:57.860
- Yes!

00:01:57.860 --> 00:01:59.830
I already love this story.

00:01:59.830 --> 00:02:01.287
- And my buddy goes,

00:02:01.287 --> 00:02:03.640
"I bet if we just drove
a limo in tomorrow,

00:02:03.640 --> 00:02:05.050
just got in that limo line,

00:02:05.050 --> 00:02:08.660
we could just hop out
of the car and walk in."

00:02:08.660 --> 00:02:10.948
And I was like...
(audience reacts)

00:02:10.948 --> 00:02:13.477
Yeah, there, that's me!
- Oh my God, you are a baby!

00:02:14.321 --> 00:02:16.082
(audience applauds)
Oh my God.

00:02:16.082 --> 00:02:20.161
You are a true little tiny
baby, look at that baby face.

00:02:20.161 --> 00:02:22.108
- That's two months before
I started "That 70's Show".

00:02:22.108 --> 00:02:23.051
We couldn't even afford...

00:02:23.051 --> 00:02:24.925
- That's like two months
before you hit puberty!

00:02:24.925 --> 00:02:26.281
(audience laughs)

00:02:26.281 --> 00:02:27.114
- It's one and the same, one and the same.

00:02:28.220 --> 00:02:30.420
We got in the limo, we pulled up,

00:02:30.420 --> 00:02:31.800
we got out of the car, waved,

00:02:31.800 --> 00:02:34.400
everyone in the audience
goes like, "Whoa, like, who?"

00:02:34.400 --> 00:02:37.340
And by the time they knew that
they didn't know who we were,

00:02:37.340 --> 00:02:39.320
we got in there and we
were on the red carpet.

00:02:39.320 --> 00:02:41.460
We saw Tyra Banks, which
is a big deal for us.

00:02:41.460 --> 00:02:43.367
And then we saw you!

00:02:43.367 --> 00:02:45.320
(Drew squeals)
(audience applauds)

00:02:45.320 --> 00:02:48.110
- Was it the year I had
the daisies in my hair?

00:02:48.110 --> 00:02:51.499
- Yeah, you had, I know you
got a big thing for, yep.

00:02:51.499 --> 00:02:52.985
(audience applaud and whoop)

00:02:52.985 --> 00:02:55.130
- I love it so much, buddy, good for you.

00:02:55.130 --> 00:02:55.963
That is...

00:02:57.017 --> 00:02:59.260
That's the kinda spirit

00:02:59.260 --> 00:03:01.420
that speaks to me.

00:03:01.420 --> 00:03:03.960
I love that moxie.

00:03:03.960 --> 00:03:05.930
That actually dovetails perfectly

00:03:05.930 --> 00:03:08.800
into something I also
have to ask you about,

00:03:08.800 --> 00:03:13.760
which is this text chain with
Tom Cruise and Meryl Streep.

00:03:13.760 --> 00:03:15.540
Topher, spill it all.

00:03:15.540 --> 00:03:16.810
Tell me everything.

00:03:16.810 --> 00:03:19.290
- Well, look, we've been
looking for a project.

00:03:19.290 --> 00:03:20.123
The three of us.

00:03:20.123 --> 00:03:22.660
No, we, um, (laughs)
(audience laughs)

00:03:22.660 --> 00:03:24.580
I was bored, it was a pandemic.

00:03:24.580 --> 00:03:28.050
I stole my wife's phone
and I made fake texts

00:03:28.050 --> 00:03:29.860
where I'm like- (laughs)

00:03:29.860 --> 00:03:32.940
this isn't actually from
Meryl Streep, I should say,

00:03:32.940 --> 00:03:35.010
where she's just talking about
how much she loves my acting.

00:03:35.010 --> 00:03:36.480
And Tom Cruise is...

00:03:36.480 --> 00:03:38.360
and I did one from Daniel Day Lewis,

00:03:38.360 --> 00:03:41.480
where he's like "Teach
me, teach me your ways.

00:03:41.480 --> 00:03:43.220
I wanna learn how to be a good actor."

00:03:43.220 --> 00:03:44.830
- [Drew] So wait, do you
go in your wife's phone

00:03:44.830 --> 00:03:47.756
and create a contact?
- Yeah. (laughs)

00:03:47.756 --> 00:03:48.890
- 'Cause it looks legit.

00:03:48.890 --> 00:03:49.970
I love this.
- Yeah.

00:03:49.970 --> 00:03:54.360
- Okay, so if you were to text
Meryl Streep in real life,

00:03:54.360 --> 00:03:56.397
what would you say to Meryl?

00:03:56.397 --> 00:03:58.370
- "Oh my God, you're the
greatest of all time.

00:03:58.370 --> 00:04:00.098
Sorry for texting you."

00:04:00.098 --> 00:04:00.960
(audience laughs)

00:04:00.960 --> 00:04:02.300
- And Tom Cruise?

00:04:02.300 --> 00:04:04.060
- I'd say, "Take it down a notch, dude.

00:04:04.060 --> 00:04:05.260
You're gonna die."

00:04:05.260 --> 00:04:06.457
(audience laughs)
(Drew laughs)

00:04:06.457 --> 00:04:07.860
"We don't need all these stunts,

00:04:07.860 --> 00:04:09.545
you can use your stunt double."

00:04:09.545 --> 00:04:12.128
(bright music)

